forge-leviathan-drake-round-end = void drake
forge-leviathan-worm-round-end = void worm
forge-leviathan-medusa-round-end = void medusa

ghost-role-information-forge-void-drake-name = Void Drake
ghost-role-information-forge-void-drake-description = You are an astral leviathan. Hunt ships, crush hulls with gravity and starfire, and do not play nice with the crew.

ghost-role-information-forge-void-worm-name = Void Worm
ghost-role-information-forge-void-worm-description = You are a cosmic worm. Warp through vacuum, swallow prey, smash hulls with your coil, and spawn a hungry brood.

ghost-role-information-forge-void-medusa-name = Void Medusa
ghost-role-information-forge-void-medusa-description = You are a cosmic jellyfish. Latch shuttles, EMP their guts, freeze the crew, and rain shock polyps. You do not chew hulls — you steal ships.

station-event-forge-void-drake-start = Sensors scream: an astral leviathan has entered the sector. Void drake inbound.
station-event-forge-void-worm-start = Gravimetrics just folded. A void worm is burrowing through local space.
station-event-forge-void-medusa-start = Comms fill with static. A void medusa is blooming in local space — thrusters may not save you.

forge-leviathan-drake-gravity = The void drake collapses space around itself!
forge-leviathan-drake-tempest = The void drake beats its wings into a tempest!
forge-leviathan-drake-flare = The void drake ignites like a dying star!

forge-leviathan-worm-warp = The void worm tears a hole through space!
forge-leviathan-worm-coil = The void worm coils and SMASHES!
forge-leviathan-worm-brood = The void worm sheds a living brood!
forge-leviathan-worm-crush = The void worm wraps the hull and CRUSHES!
forge-leviathan-worm-split = The void worm splits — two hungers where one was!

forge-leviathan-medusa-latch = The void medusa latches the hull and DRAGS!
forge-leviathan-medusa-ion = The void medusa blooms — every console screams static!
forge-leviathan-medusa-stasis = The void medusa veils the sector in stasis!
forge-leviathan-medusa-polyp = The void medusa sheds a rain of living polyps!

petting-success-forge-void-drake = You scratch {THE($target)} behind a horn. It allows it. Barely.
petting-failure-forge-void-drake = You reach for {THE($target)} and it nearly takes the arm as tribute.
petting-success-forge-void-worm = You tap {THE($target)}. A segment blinks at you. Unsettling.
petting-failure-forge-void-worm = {THE($target)} almost swallows your hand whole.
petting-success-forge-void-medusa = You brush a tentacle. It tastes your gloves for current and lets go.
petting-failure-forge-void-medusa = A tentacle kisses your wrist. Everything electric in you skips a beat.
